      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The target is Georgia's state row for reporting period 202608, original submission O, in dataset 5abea2e0-3f8e-4b49-a50d-d63d5fd9103c. It is a monthly administrative percentage. The ledger does not explicitly name its denominator column; CMS's state renewal tables identify the denominator as all beneficiaries due for renewal. I therefore use Metric 5a1 divided by Metric 5. Resolution remains the first published original row, rounded to one decimal."
