        "call": "Fetch CMS April, May, and June 2026 snapshots listed in sourceContext; read the original current-month Georgia renewal tables.",
        "result": "April 2026: 239,136 beneficiaries due, 48% renewed ex parte. May 2026: 233,202 due, 47% ex parte. June 2026: 231,064 due, 45% ex parte; 61% were renewed overall and 11% remained pending. The June snapshot is dated September 25, 2026."
